  "body_html": "<h1>final_holding_injective</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\nlemma final_holding_injective : ∀ j1 j2 : Fin n, ∀ i : Fin n, (finalState w m).holding j1 = some i → (finalState w m).holding j2 = some i → j1 = j2</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>finalState</li>\n<li>holding_injective_run</li>\n<li>initState</li>\n<li>initState_injective</li>\n</ul>",
